---
// Two ways to combine many trees. Schematic; no data.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 380;
---
<figure class="atp08-en">
  <div class="atp08-en-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two lanes. Random forest: three deep trees are trained side by side on different random samples of the rows and columns, and their scores are averaged. Boosting: shallow trees are trained one after another, each one fitted to the mistakes left by the trees before it, and their scores are added.">
      <DiagramIcon name="model" x={22} y={22} size={22} />
      <text x="44" y="28" class="h">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Many trees, two ways to combine them</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Nhiều cây, hai cách ghép lại</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="20" y="52" width="860" height="142" rx="8" class="lane" />
      <text x="36" y="76" class="lt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Random forest: side by side, then average</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Random forest: song song, rồi lấy trung bình</tspan>
      </text>
      {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={60 + i * 150} y={94} width="120" height="64" rx="6" class="box" />
          <DiagramIcon name="model" x={80 + i * 150} y={118} size={20} />
          <text x={96 + i * 150} y={114} class="bt">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{`Deep tree ${i + 1}`}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{`Cây sâu ${i + 1}`}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={72 + i * 150} y={142} class="bs">
            <tspan data-lang-en>own rows, own columns</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>hàng, cột riêng</tspan>
          </text>
          <polygon points={`${186 + i * 150},120 ${186 + i * 150},132 ${198 + i * 150},126`} class="arr" />
        </g>
      ))}
      <rect x="520" y="94" width="130" height="64" rx="6" class="box key" />
      <text x="585" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Average</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Trung bình</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="585" y="142" text-anchor="middle" class="bs">
        <tspan data-lang-en>noise cancels</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>nhiễu triệt tiêu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="116" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Each tree overfits in its own</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi cây overfit theo kiểu riêng</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="134" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>direction; the average keeps</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>của nó; trung bình giữ lại phần</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="152" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>what the trees agree on.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>các cây cùng đồng ý.</tspan>
      </text>

      <rect x="20" y="208" width="860" height="150" rx="8" class="lane" />
      <text x="36" y="232" class="lt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Boosting: one after another, each fixes the last</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Boosting: lần lượt, cây sau sửa cây trước</tspan>
      </text>
      {[0, 1, 2].map((i) => (
        <g>
          <rect x={60 + i * 150} y={250} width="120" height="64" rx="6" class="box" />
          <DiagramIcon name="model" x={80 + i * 150} y={274} size={20} />
          <text x={96 + i * 150} y={270} class="bt">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{`Shallow tree ${i + 1}`}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{`Cây nông ${i + 1}`}</tspan>
          </text>
          <text x={72 + i * 150} y={298} class="bs">
            <tspan data-lang-en>{i === 0 ? 'fits the returns' : 'fits what is left'}</tspan>
            <tspan data-lang-vi>{i === 0 ? 'khớp lợi suất' : 'khớp phần còn dư'}</tspan>
          </text>
          <polygon points={`${186 + i * 150},276 ${186 + i * 150},288 ${198 + i * 150},282`} class="arr" />
        </g>
      ))}
      <rect x="520" y="250" width="130" height="64" rx="6" class="box key" />
      <text x="585" y="278" text-anchor="middle" class="bt">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Sum of steps</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Tổng các bước</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="585" y="298" text-anchor="middle" class="bs">
        <tspan data-lang-en>small learning rate</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>learning rate nhỏ</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="272" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Each step is small on purpose;</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Mỗi bước cố ý đi ngắn;</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="290" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>too many steps and it starts</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>đi quá nhiều bước thì bắt đầu</tspan>
      </text>
      <text x="676" y="308" class="note">
        <tspan data-lang-en>fitting noise, so stop early.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>khớp cả nhiễu, nên phải dừng sớm.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Both ideas replace one fragile tree with many. A forest cuts variance by averaging; boosting cuts error step by step and needs a brake.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Cả hai ý tưởng đều thay một cây mong manh bằng nhiều cây. Forest giảm phương sai bằng cách lấy trung bình; boosting giảm sai số từng bước và cần có phanh.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp08-en { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp08-en-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp08-en svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .atp08-en text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp08-en .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp08-en .lt { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp08-en .bt { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp08-en .bs { font-size: 11.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp08-en .note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp08-en .lane { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp08-en .box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.3; }
  .atp08-en .box.key { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .atp08-en .arr { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp08-en figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
